?#tr.en: @vart[t135.v5,t135.v5]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} It should have no rival. } Mankind, all of the people, should prostrate themselves at her (?) feet.”}
?#tr.en: And now, under that sun and on that day, it was indeed so.
